<aside class="guide-note"><h2>Use examples before private files</h2><p>The downloadable samples contain no customer data and are free to use when trying these tools. Merge, Split, JPG to PDF and Compress PDF perform the workflows described here in the browser. Other tools may use external services; read their processing details before uploading.</p></aside>
